  "id": "tasks/a-delegated-turn-failing-after-a-tool-round-keeps-its-end",
  "title": "A delegated agent whose model fails on the generation after a tool round fails the task with its error and keeps its turn's end: its loop_end_reason error and its last narration as the output, on ON_TASK_COMPLETED too, inline or in the background, whether a transport is shared into the child room or not",
